A short comment about the Development Team's policy regarding
controversial suggestions posted here or emailed to us:

It is our policy not to engage _as a team_ in a debate over the
merits of controversial suggestions, although individual associates
are free to engage in it as they please -- speaking for themselves.
We felt all along, and we still do, that the outcome of our efforts
is better served by our _listening_ to what the various sides in a
debate have to say than by jumping into it.  That policy helped us
in making changes in the game which we consider balanced changes, and
we will continue to adhere to it.


For the Development Team,

-Izchak


